    "Name": "Yinghuochong YHC-3E",
    "Details": "Introduced in 3144, the Yinghuochong is a 35 ton Capellan Confederation light Mech. Built using a modified Firebee chassis, the Yinghuochong is designed as a scout killer and recon mech. Built around a 210-rated XL Engine and armored in Light Ferro-Fibrous; the Yinghuochong YHC-3E is armed with a Clan ER PPC and a TAG. A Remote Sensor Dispenser and Improved Jump Jets improve the Yinghuochongs scouting capability.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Cooling Jacket - PPC</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.98</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
